        "description": "Presence of acanthosis nigricans",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of near-total adipose tissue loss, pathogenic BSCL2 mutation, and metabolic complications",
